    "effect": "Braided Utility Rope. Has a tensile strength of 80kg or 176lbs. It has 20 Hit Points and 10 Damage Reduction.\n\nRope can only be damaged by Fire-Type attacks, attacks made with sharp objects (knives, swords, sharp teeth), and moves like @UUID[Compendium.ptu.moves.Item.1Sk8xyD2S2J6qU1K]{Scratch}, @UUID[Compendium.ptu.moves.Item.sm3q5D8SkQcEmiGB]{Slash}, @UUID[Compendium.ptu.moves.Item.0wyKb3JsjxCnVsr6]{Leaf Blade}, @UUID[Compendium.ptu.moves.Item.wYz4RubDs84tDVul]{Razor Leaf}, etc. The Move @UUID[Compendium.ptu.moves.Item.UkCThqEzC82ABM7h]{Cut} ignores all Damage Reduction against Rope. Rope can be bought in any length from 25ft. up to 300ft.",
